                Institutional Hysteresis in Climate Adaptation:
                The Asymmetric Impact of Macroeconomic Uncertainty
                in Developing Nations
            </h3>

            <p>
                Chowdhury, N. A., Nishe, S. N., Hasan, M. & Mohanta, A. K.
            </p>

            <p class="status">
                Under Review
            </p>

        </div>

    </div>


    <div class="publication">

        <div class="publication-year">
            2026
        </div>

        <div>

            <h3>
                Farmers' Perception and Adaptation toward Climate Change
                in the Southwestern Coastal Region of Bangladesh
            </h3>

            <p>
                International Conference on Soil, Water and Environmental
                Resilience in the Coastal Zone of Bangladesh under a
                Changing Climate.
            </p>

        </div>

    </div>

</section>


